{title: Tanha Hua}
{artist: Rahat Fateh Ali Khan Ajay Atul}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Rabba [Fm]duhaiyaan,        [G#]Ruthi [A#]parchaiyaan
[Cm]jane [Fm]anjaane [G#],        Me [Cm]bar-bar tanha
Me [Fm]roz-rozz tanha,        Me [G#]beshumaar tanha [Cm]hua
[Cm] Ankh me nhi hai dekho
[D#]Qatraa koi bhi uska [Fm],        [Cm]haa
[Cm]Oro ka to hona kya tha,        [D#]Apna bhi me na ho [Fm]saka
[Cm]aaa?        [Cm]Dil ki [Fm]geharaiyaan
[G#]Poochein [A#]sachhaiyaan,        [Cm]jaane [Fm]anjaane
Me [Cm]baar-baar tanha,        Me [Fm]roz-roz tanha
Me [G#]beshumaar tanha [Cm]hua,        [Cm]Duniya ka mela dekhun
[Cm]Khud ko akela dekhun,        [Cm]Dil albela dekhun gamzada
[Cm]Dekhle aye [D#]dil [Fm]bewaafa,        [Fm]Chaahaton [G#]me krke [D#]waffa
[Cm]Yaadon se pa lunga me,        [Cm]Apna bna lunga me
[Cm]Jaan gawaa lunga me is daffa,        [Cm]Meri [Fm]agwayiyaan
[G#]Krti [A#]ruswayiyaan,        [Cm]jaane [Fm]anjaane
Me [Cm]yaar-yaar khna,        Me [Fm]yaar-yaar kehna
Ohdey [G#]naal-naal rhna [Cm]sadaa,        Me [Cm]baar-baar tanha
Me [Fm]roz-roz tanha,        Me [G#]beshumaar tanha [Cm]hua
